{"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"DismissAction","kind":"identifier"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use the "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/EnvironmentValues\/dismiss"},{"type":"text","text":" environment value to get the instance"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of this structure for a given "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Environment"},{"type":"text","text":". Then call the instance"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to perform the dismissal. You call the instance directly because"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it defines a "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/DismissAction\/callAsFunction()"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"method that Swift calls when you call the instance."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For example, you can create a button that calls the "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/DismissAction"},{"type":"text","text":":"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":null,"code":["private struct SheetContents: View {","    @Environment(\\.dismiss) private var dismiss","","    var body: some View {","        Button(\"Done\") {","            dismiss()","        }","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If you present the "},{"code":"SheetContents","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" view in a sheet, the user can dismiss"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the sheet by tapping or clicking the sheet’s button:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":null,"code":["private struct DetailView: View {","    @State private var isSheetPresented = false","","    var body: some View {","        Button(\"Show Sheet\") {","            isSheetPresented = true","        }","        .sheet(isPresented: $isSheetPresented) {","            SheetContents()","        }","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Be sure that you define the action in the appropriate environment.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"For example, don’t reorganize the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"DetailView"},{"text":" in the example above","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"so that it creates the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"dismiss"},{"text":" property and calls it from the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"View\/sheet(item:onDismiss:content:)"},{"text":" view modifier’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"content"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"closure:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":null,"code":["private struct DetailView: View {","    @State private var isSheetPresented = false","    @Environment(\\.dismiss) private var dismiss \/\/ Applies to DetailView.","","    var body: some View {","        Button(\"Show Sheet\") {","            isSheetPresented = true","        }","        .sheet(isPresented: $isSheetPresented) {","            Button(\"Done\") {","                dismiss() \/\/ Fails to dismiss the sheet.","            }","        }","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"If you do this, the sheet fails to dismiss because the action applies","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to the environment where you declared it, which is that of the detail","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"view, rather than the sheet. In fact, if you’ve presented the detail","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"view in a ","type":"text"},{"code":"NavigationView","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", the dismissal pops the detail view","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"from the navigation stack.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The dismiss action has no effect on a view that isn’t currently","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"presented. If you need to query whether OpenSwiftUI is currently presenting","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a view, read the ","type":"text"},{"code":"EnvironmentValues\/isPresented","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" environment value.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An action that dismisses a presentation."}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/openswiftui\/dismissaction"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI"]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/DismissAction"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/DismissAction\/init(action:)"],"generated":true,"title":"Initializers"},{"anchor":"Instance-Methods","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/DismissAction\/callAsFunction()"],"generated":true,"title":"Instance Methods"},{"anchor":"Default-Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/DismissAction\/Equatable-Implementations"],"generated":true,"title":"Default Implementations"}],"metadata":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"DismissAction"}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"DismissAction","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","symbolKind":"struct","modules":[{"name":"OpenSwiftUI"}],"roleHeading":"Structure